      "q": "1. Multiple choice questions.\nQ1. Who composed the pillar inscription known as the pray\u0101ga pra\u015bhasti, which praises Samudragupta?\n(a) \u0100ryabha\u1e6da\n(b) Harisena\n(c) K\u0101lid\u0101sa\n(d) Var\u0101hamihira",
